    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invaders Tower Defense Online</strong> (ITDO) is an exciting strategy game that combines attack and defense elements. Get ready to build your ultimate defense with a combination of powerful towers and face your opponents with strong invaders. This game offers a unique and immersive experience for all tower defense enthusiasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826540/extras/88836d77784a41860dbf34ee0ad73579.poster.avif?t=1744048347\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826540/extras/88836d77784a41860dbf34ee0ad73579.webm?t=1744048347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826540/extras/88836d77784a41860dbf34ee0ad73579.mp4?t=1744048347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1. Balance between Attack and Defense:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Start with 400 credits and 100 lives to defend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Receive an income of 200 credits per round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Invaders that cross the board reduce their lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sending raiders costs credits, but also increases your income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each round lasts 12 seconds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>2. Variety of Invaders and Towers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight over 30 different types of attackers. Each attacker has specific abilities and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from over 15 types of towers to strategically position. Each tower has its own characteristics and abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>3. Maps and Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore over 10 different maps, each with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Try different game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1v1 Duel Mode: Take on another player in exciting matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2v2 Team Mode: Form a team with a friend and fight against another duo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free-for-All (FFA) mode: All against all! Be the last player standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Matches against AI: Hone your skills against artificial intelligence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defense Mode: Survive as long as you can against waves of increasingly stronger invaders.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invaders Tower Defense Online</strong> (ITDO) is an exciting strategy game that combines attack and defense elements. Get ready to build your ultimate defense with a combination of powerful towers and face your opponents with strong invaders. This game offers a unique and immersive experience for all tower defense enthusiasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826540/extras/88836d77784a41860dbf34ee0ad73579.poster.avif?t=1744048347\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826540/extras/88836d77784a41860dbf34ee0ad73579.webm?t=1744048347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826540/extras/88836d77784a41860dbf34ee0ad73579.mp4?t=1744048347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1. Balance between Attack and Defense:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Start with 400 credits and 100 lives to defend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Receive an income of 200 credits per round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Invaders that cross the board reduce their lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sending raiders costs credits, but also increases your income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each round lasts 12 seconds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>2. Variety of Invaders and Towers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight over 30 different types of attackers. Each attacker has specific abilities and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from over 15 types of towers to strategically position. Each tower has its own characteristics and abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>3. Maps and Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore over 10 different maps, each with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Try different game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1v1 Duel Mode: Take on another player in exciting matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2v2 Team Mode: Form a team with a friend and fight against another duo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free-for-All (FFA) mode: All against all! Be the last player standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Matches against AI: Hone your skills against artificial intelligence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defense Mode: Survive as long as you can against waves of increasingly stronger invaders.</p></li></ul>",
